<title>USA: American General buys Home Beneficial.</title>
<headline>American General buys Home Beneficial.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>American General Corp said Wednesday it completed the previously announced acquisition of Home Beneficial Corp.</p>
<p>Home Beneficial shareholders elected to receive $287 million in cash and 9.4 million shares of American General common stock.</p>
<p>In connection with the close of the transaction, Home Beneficial paid a special dividend of $300 million to American General representing excess capital, proceeds of which will be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
